---
// O/X 퀴즈. 자바스크립트가 없어도 「정답 보기」를 눌러 답을 볼 수 있어요.
// 답한 내용은 어디에도 저장·전송하지 않아요.
interface Props { items: { q: string; answer: 'O' | 'X'; explain?: string }[] }
const { items } = Astro.props;
---
<section aria-labelledby="quiz-title">
  <h2 id="quiz-title">O/X 퀴즈</h2>
  <ol class="quiz">
    {items.map((it, i) => (
      <li class="quiz-item" data-answer={it.answer}>
        <p class="quiz-q">Q{i + 1}. {it.q}</p>
        <div class="quiz-buttons" role="group" aria-label={`Q${i + 1} 답 고르기`}>
          <button type="button" data-pick="O" aria-pressed="false">O</button>
          <button type="button" data-pick="X" aria-pressed="false">X</button>
        </div>
        <p class="quiz-feedback" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <details>
          <summary>정답 보기</summary>
          <p><strong>정답: {it.answer}</strong>{it.explain && <> — {it.explain}</>}</p>
        </details>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.quiz-item').forEach((item) => {
    const answer = item.dataset.answer;
    const feedback = item.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.quiz-feedback')!;
    const details = item.querySelector('details')!;
    const buttons = item.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-pick]');
    buttons.forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const right = btn.dataset.pick === answer;
        buttons.forEach((b) => {
          b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b === btn));
          b.classList.remove('right', 'wrong');
        });
        btn.classList.add(right ? 'right' : 'wrong');
        feedback.textContent = right ? '맞았어요!' : '아쉬워요. 다시 생각해 볼까요?';
        feedback.className = 'quiz-feedback ' + (right ? 'right' : 'wrong');
        if (right) details.open = true;
      });
    });
  });
</script>
